    outlook: "The outlook for private market platforms like Clear Street\'s is broadly positive, driven by sustained investor demand for high-growth tech companies staying private longer. Databricks is positioned in a critical sector, and its eventual IPO is highly anticipated. However, the path forward will be influenced by global macroeconomic conditions, particularly interest rate trends and overall market appetite for growth assets. Clear Street\'s success will depend on its ability to onboard compelling private companies and provide robust, transparent research, effectively balancing the allure of early access with the inherent risks of illiquidity and valuation. The platform\'s expansion to 30 companies by year-end suggests an aggressive strategy to capture market share in this evolving space.",
