    opportunities: ["Long-term adoption by institutional investors and corporations.", "Development of more robust regulatory frameworks providing clarity and stability.", "Integration of blockchain technology into traditional finance, as seen with stablecoin initiatives.", "Bitcoin\'s role as a decentralized store of value in an increasingly digital economy.", "Potential for a broader market rebound if macroeconomic conditions improve."],
