    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring Bitcoin. The central focus is a stylized chart showing an upward trend for July, overlaid with subtle, abstract representations of macro headwinds like rising interest rates (upward arrow with dollar sign), economic uncertainty (question mark), and an \'AI\' chip dissolving, all in muted, cool tones. In the foreground, a prominent Bitcoin logo (BTC) is subtly integrated, suggesting stability amidst the chaos. The overall aesthetic is professional, financial, and slightly futuristic, with a clean layout suitable for a financial intelligence platform. Use a wide-angle perspective to include subtle background elements hinting at global markets without being distracting.",
