      keyRisks: ["Failure to meet investor expectations for AI return on investment.", "Increased competition from hyperscale cloud providers and AI startups.", "Adverse regulatory decisions impacting business segments.", "Significant global economic slowdown reducing enterprise demand.", "Unforeseen technological disruptions or security breaches."],
