      potentialCatalysts: ["Faster-than-expected growth in AI adoption and HBM demand.", "Successful execution of new factory builds and equipment integration.", "Inclusion in major US equity indices post-listing.", "Further technological breakthroughs in HBM or next-gen memory.", "Strong earnings reports demonstrating continued market share gains."],
