    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the multifaceted nature of the crypto market: on one side, a sleek, futuristic digital coin with a \'Big Tech\' and \'Wall Street\' emblem, symbolizing institutional stablecoin innovation; in the center, a fractured, glitching robotic hand reaching for scattered digital currency, representing DeFi exploits and security risks; on the other side, a subtle, blurred silhouette of a celebrity figure overlaid with a blockchain network connecting to a water droplet icon, symbolizing celebrity endorsements and reputation management. The overall color palette should be a blend of corporate blues, digital greens, and subtle warning reds, conveying both progress and peril. Dynamic lines and abstract shapes connect these elements, illustrating the intertwined nature of these trends. High-detail, cinematic lighting.",
